    "title": "OLCI True Colour Under Sentinel-5P Products",
    "description": "Overlays a Sentinel-5P (TROPOMI) atmospheric product as a colour ramp on top of a Sentinel-3 OLCI true-colour base map, falling back to the true-colour image wherever the atmospheric product has no data. Supports cloud pressure/height/fraction/optical thickness, trace gases (CO, HCHO, NO2, O3, SO2, CH4), and UV aerosol index. Adapted from a SentinelHub Custom Script by Monja B. \u0160ebela.",
